des) + required §8.10 documentation + the acceptance battery. (4) r5 dispatched to glm-5.3 (the owner's lane for this unit): the two scoped VM hunks, routing consults authentic? (shape = cheap pre-filter for WHEN to ask, never decides meaning), astra's reconciliation checklist binding (call.cljc:23 _descriptor, clojure.cljc:1245/1403/1458, ts prelude:135 + lower:1167, py prelude:1033, php prelude:4229), the collision-literal + bearer-copy + exposure-probe regressions, the docs. (5) BLAST-RADIUS ANALYSIS for the owner (grounded by grep): VM additive only (no vocabulary pins exist; state/protocol unchanged; the boolean oracle leaks nothing the fatal check didn't); the shared _descriptor definition is the CONTAINMENT mechanism (fix once, all convention frontends inherit); shape-routing sweep = 4 files (PHP doesn't route cell-ref shape — doc only); behavior delta strictly widening (aborts become answers; genuine refs unchanged). TWO DOMINO CANDIDATES: (a) benign-by-design — clojure_test.clj:2131 pins the superseded refusal semantics and must be rewritten to the ruled answer-as-data behavior; (b) VERIFY — latte_oracle_test registers the cell module, so IF the kernel gate's candidate inventory counted VM-module functions, authentic?/1 would enter as unexercised (20→21) and H3-3 could never fully unblock the gate; the seat's reading is the inventory is latte-kernel-scoped (all 20 entries are latte-kernel.*), and the remote 4M gate rerun in r5 verification will confirm the counts unchanged (102/2/2 + the same 20). Both candidates go into the codex gate brief so the reviewer checks them independently.\\\\norchestrator-logs/1793385006-zcode-glm-5.3-flash-yang-clojure-track.md:550:Done: (1) The remote battery on the STRIPPED tree (jupiter, CURRENT-STRIPPED): matrix 13/21/0 (incl. the collision-literal regression), full yang.clojure-test 95/922/0, yang.base 126/0, the NEW yin.vm cell-test 17/197/0. The revert verified EXACT (empty diff vs f35c65c2 on both prelude files — the ac