{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"The main preservation gaps are at the boundaries: the encoder rebuilds side tables, safepoint derivation currently clears them, publication drops the linearizer’s provenance result, and reconstructed ASTs share nodes by content. The design will require occurrence-aware handling at each boundary so identical subtrees retain distinct caller identities."}}
